msgstr "Tradiksyon sa a pa ka itilize nan RustyPresenter. Tanpri chwazi yon lòt Bib."

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "This verse came from an older version; look the passage up again to choose breaks here."
msgstr "Vèsè sa a soti nan yon vèsyon ki pi ansyen; chèche pasaj la ankò pou chwazi kote pou koupe diapo yo."

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "One passage used a translation that can't be used in RustyPresenter and was removed."
msgid_plural "{n} passages used a translation that can't be used in RustyPresenter and were removed."
msgstr[0] "Yon pasaj te itilize yon tradiksyon ki pa ka itilize nan RustyPresenter, yo retire l."
msgstr[1] "{n} pasaj te itilize yon tradiksyon ki pa ka itilize nan RustyPresenter, yo retire yo."

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "Ready on this computer"
msgstr "Pare sou òdinatè sa a"

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "Ready (needs internet)"
msgstr "Pare (bezwen entènèt)"

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "Needs a key — Get one"
msgstr "Bezwen yon kle — Jwenn youn"

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "Not available"
msgstr "Pa disponib"

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "Search: Ready"
msgstr "Rechèch: Pare"

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "Search: online (ESV)"
msgstr "Rechèch: sou entènèt (ESV)"

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "Search works for the translations stored on this computer (KJV and any bundled or imported Bible). Online translations can't be searched, because their owners don't allow it (ESV may offer its own online search)."
msgstr "Rechèch mache pou tradiksyon ki sou òdinatè sa a (KJV ak nenpòt Bib ki enstale ladan l oswa enpòte). Ou pa ka chèche nan tradiksyon sou entènèt, paske mèt yo pa pèmèt sa (ESV ka ofri pwòp rechèch sou entènèt li)."

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "Every word must appear in the verse (love neighbour finds verses with both)."
msgstr "Chak mo dwe parèt nan vèsè a (love neighbour jwenn vèsè ki gen toude)."

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "Words match their beginnings: love finds love, loved, loveth, lovest, loving. Words shorter than 3 letters must match exactly."
msgstr "Mo yo koresponn ak kòmansman yo: love jwenn love, loved, loveth, lovest, loving. Mo ki gen mwens pase 3 lèt dwe koresponn egzakteman."

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "Put words in quotes for an exact phrase: \"be still\"."
msgstr "Mete mo yo ant gimè pou yon fraz egzak: \"be still\"."

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "Capitals and punctuation do not matter. lord finds LORD."
msgstr "Majiskil ak ponktiyasyon pa konte. lord jwenn LORD."

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "Best matches come first: verses with your exact words in order, then verses where the words are close together, then the rest in Bible order. Switch to Bible order to see Genesis first."
msgstr "Pi bon rezilta yo vini anvan: vèsè ki gen mo egzak ou yo nan lòd, apre sa vèsè kote mo yo pre youn ak lòt, apre sa rès yo nan lòd Bib la. Chanje pou lòd Bib la pou wè Jenèz an premye."

#: src/strings/scripture.rs
msgid "Ctrl+Enter in the Bible box always searches, even for a book name like \"Job\"."
msgstr "Ctrl+Enter nan bwat Bib la toujou chèche, menm pou yon non liv tankou \"Jòb\"."

